# TEST FIXTURE - NOT ORGANIZATIONAL TRUTH.
#
# The one edge that crosses between the layers, and the whole of what this file is for.
#
# It points upward: the repository realizes the capability, never the reverse, because
# a capability has to survive the deletion of every system that ever delivered it. It
# is authored by a human here rather than imported, and no GitHub import writes one -
# a source knows what it contains, not what the organization is accountable for.
