# The two ends live in different files on purpose, and in different graphs. The
# capability is curated L1 truth under ../../valid/worked-example.ttl; the edge is
# observed L2 truth here. Nothing in L1 points down, and nothing here authors an L1
# entity: a business node written into this directory is rejected by
# shpt:CuratedFactInTheObservedGraphShape, and business-fact-in-the-observed-graph.ttl
# is the fixture that proves it.

